 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Past Konjunktiv II with modals",
     "texto": [
      "When an unfulfilled obligation in the past is judged, the compound form is used: **hätte** + infinitive of the full verb + infinitive of the modal verb at the end (**Ersatzinfinitiv**): **Die Geschäftsführung hätte den Bericht früher einreichen müssen** (the management should have submitted the report earlier). In this pattern the modal does not take the participle gemusst, but its infinitive form after the other verb."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Meaning and discursive nuance",
     "texto": [
      "In audits and arbitrations this construction is used to point out organisational failures without resorting to direct accusations in the present: **Der Projektleiter hätte das Risiko rechtzeitig melden müssen** (the project manager should have reported the risk on time)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "Structure",
     "columnas": [
